To add an interactive tooltip to the SVG, we can use the `title` attribute on the `svg` element and then use JavaScript to create a tooltip that appears when the user hovers over the SVG. We'll also add some basic styling to make the tooltip look decent.

Here's an updated version of the SVG with the tooltip:

